Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Certify the spectrum-matched master: verified, with
 nothing added under the voice

The EQ-only match now passes all ten gates, including the new one: the delivered
master equals the declared filtered dry master to the sample (max absolute
difference printed below, zero time lag, identical length), the picture stream is
bit-identical, 237/237 pieces are the approved takes with 0.0454 ms alignment,
coverage 0.983231 with a 0.42 s worst gap and a 0.45 s quiet hole. The report is
kept beside the chain report rather than over final-dub-source-sync.mp4, because
this is a candidate for listening: the published render stays until a voice is
chosen from the gallery, and the room-tone question is closed for this source by
measurement, not by taste.

pending-pushes/ carries the unpushed commits as patches, since the GitHub token
rotated mid-session and .git/config is not restored by the sandbox snapshot.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
